    "body": "References #983\n\n## Outcome\n\nImplements and records the independently frozen `ConstructionCausalReturnV1` Gate 0 experiment.\n\n- raw census: `blake3:5e970efe79c13d38e02eab6ff60642d3d449ce9dc571af6425b16d0d94858017`\n- sealed label join: `blake3:5aa4b1c5880f660bc463a0650ebf21603d63170252b56e03e9a93e0a07e28c76`\n- sealed outcome: `blake3:58fba09dba1b9245cb62a73bf8e3ac153242dc0730e3df7586446aa2820d4587`\n- usable construction classes: pure\n- structural coverage: 0/6\n- sealed strict ceiling: 0/6\n- all eleven negative controls: 0/6\n- count-only comparator: 0/6\n- terminal: `UNAVAILABLE_ZERO_CONSTRUCTION_TRANSFER`\n\nThe hard gate stopped before any deployed selector or payload inversion. #953 fixture, selector, decoded generation, and replay were not run or changed. This is bounded negative evidence for the frozen representation and placement, not a rejection of H4, paired-H4/E8, trigonometric, prime/semiprime, or alternative corpus-induced mechanisms.\n\n## Verification\n\nPassed: raw-census reproduction with the complete 21-`R_min`/24-`R_full` inventory; sealed outcome reproduction; four unignored #983 tests; focused #969 regression; focused core check; strict #983-target Clippy after isolating unrelated baseline lints; formatting, diff, claim wording, #953 quarantine, and WASM compatibility.\n\nDependency-inclusive all-target Clippy remains non-clean on pre-existing warnings in unchanged files. Workspace, BDD, teacher/model, kappa reproduction, corpus-scale, audit, fuzz, conformance, product, performance, formal, and release suites remain `NOT_RUN`.\n\nNegative-delivery semantics: leave #983 open as the evidence and next-representation home; keep #953 parked, unassigned, untouched, and blocked.",
